    <briefdescription>
<para>Time-Series Storage MVP (Sprint B). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Simple time-series storage for metrics and events with range queries.</para>
<para>Key Schema: ts:{metric}:{entity}:{timestamp_ms} Value: double (for simple metrics) or JSON (for complex events)</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Put data points with timestamp</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Range queries (from_time, to_time)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Basic aggregations: min, max, avg, sum, count</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optional bucketing/downsampling</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>MVP Scope (no compression yet):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Raw storage in RocksDB</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Range scans via prefix iteration</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>In-memory aggregation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Follow-up: Gorilla compression, retention policies </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
